{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよ～٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は私の中の犬の日！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わん！わん！わん！わん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼過ぎにチップと2人でお散歩いってきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップね、今この間買ったマスタード色のトレーナーみたいなお洋服着てるんだけどね、めっちゃ似合ってるの♡かわいいの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、チップのお誕生日10月1日だったんだけどお仕事でお誕生日ケーキ買ってあげられなかったから、今週の土日に買ってお祝いしようと♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、ペットショップで\nチップときみとしろみのご飯やおかしやいろいろな物をお母さんと買いに行ったんだけどね、\nあ！この時にマスタード色のトレーナーみたいなチップのお洋服買ったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話しが飛んじゃったんだけど\nペットショップに行った時に\nもうクリスマスケーキの予約がはじまってて、、、、\nこのクリスマスケーキは犬が食べられる犬用のクリスマスケーキで、\n何種類もあるからまだ悩んでるんだ～。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップはチーズが好きだから\nチーズケーキがいいと思うんだけど、\n形的にかわいいのが丸いホール型の\nいちごケーキなんだよね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちにしよう。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日ケーキをまだ買ってないから\nお誕生日ケーキをチーズケーキにして\nクリスマスケーキを丸いホール型のいちごケーキにすればいいかな？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ♡(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいこと思いついちゃったー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名にANNA SUI MOOK本とありますが、実はあした\n11月12日に発売される\nANNA SUI MOOK本に\n飛鳥と優里さんと私の3人が\n巻頭のファッションシューティングに\n載せて頂きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ANNA SUIさんから出るMOOK本は\nあした発売されるものが第二弾ということで、とても貴重な体験をさせて頂きました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ANNA SUIさんと一緒にできるお仕事がまたできてとても嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、チェックしてください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事なアンダーライブと重なって出られなかった10月24日にあった\n新宿スタイルコレクションでの\nANNA SUIさんのステージに\n私もANNA SUIさんのお洋服をきて\nレッドカーペットを歩きたかったです。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも飛鳥から、あとから聞いたんですが\nANNA SUIのお仕事で携わっているスタッフさんが「日奈子にも会いたかった～」って言ってくださってたみたいで\nそれを聞けてすごく嬉しかったです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥ちゃんと新宿の伊勢丹に\nお買い物にいく約束をしてから\nまだ行けてないのではやく行きたいな～(｡・・｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥ちゃんのポーズかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ANNA SUI 2015 冬のビジュアルは\n新宿駅構内でみることができるので\n皆さんぜひみてください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のブログは\nANNA SUIさんのMOOK本の告知をしたかったのでこれでおわりです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、あと2枚も写真載せられるから\n何かあるかな～と思って探してたら\n優里さんと飛鳥と寄り目した変な顔の写真あったからのせちゃいます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへへ(｡-∀-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真みるだけで\nニヤニヤしちゃう(｡-∀-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ、今日はこれでおわり！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさーい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紫色のネイル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/5538182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の写真は全部\nニューヨークで撮った写真だよ！！！"}],"source":"archive"}